From 5918544c95fcc95eb80acf9ef1071340a028da05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Ewen <ryan.ewen@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 20:57:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] chat: document the client dispatch rule for tool call
 progress

The action's own JSDoc requires the server to reject a report whose
dispatching client does not own the tool call, so the validation table
should say so rather than leaving the rule only in the type.
---
 docs/specification/chat-channel.md | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/docs/specification/chat-channel.md b/docs/specification/chat-channel.md
index 647646ac3..0a0d9d2ac 100644
--- a/docs/specification/chat-channel.md
+++ b/docs/specification/chat-channel.md
@@ -224,6 +224,7 @@ When the server receives a client-dispatched action on this channel, it MUST val
 | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
 | Any action referencing a non-existent chat | Channel URI not found                                                                                                      | Server MUST silently ignore the action (no echo)                                                 |
 | `chat/toolCallConfirmed`                   | Tool call not in `pending-confirmation` state                                                                              | Server MUST reject the action                                                                    |
+| `chat/toolCallProgress`                    | Dispatching client does not match the tool call's client `contributor.clientId`                                | Server SHOULD reject the action                                                                   |
 | `chat/turnCancelled`                       | No active turn                                                                                                             | Server MUST reject the action                                                                    |
 | `chat/inputAnswerChanged`                  | No input request with matching `requestId`                                                                                 | Server SHOULD reject the action                                                                  |
 | `chat/inputAnswerChanged`                  | `answer.state` requires a value but `answer.value` is absent, or `answer.value.kind` is missing the matching payload field | Server SHOULD reject the action                                                                  |
